      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1980517818677301718",
      "text": "[7:05AM] #LagIbdExpWay\n#3MB\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nIt's still an encouraging Vehicular flow coming inward Berger from Kara bridge down to Tollgate except slight delay at Tollgate turning and Ikosi/7Up bus stop due to the activities of the commercial buses.\n\nProceeding towards Estate/Alapere and Ogudu/Ifako is also looking good at the moment.\n\nTraffic moves  gradually approaching Iyana Oworo and Ilaje due to bus stop activities at Iyana Oworo coupled with a broken down car connecting the Third mainland bridge.\n\nIt's moving faster beyond Ilaje en route Unilag water front and Adekunle.\nTraffic is flowing gradually exiting Adekunle merging point towards the Adeniji end.\n\nOn the return journey, it's a good movement all the way from Adeniji back to Iyana Oworo and Berger.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@Sola_Giwa\n@OlalekanOki\n@lagostraffic961 \n@trafficpalava",
